</address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARAI, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CITIZEN WATCH CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ARAI MAKOTO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARAI, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A TN liquid-crystal display device (20) includes 180&lt;-270? twisted nematic liquid crystal (6) interposed between a first transparent substrate (1) and a second transparent substrate (2) that have electrodes (3, 4) opposed to each other on the insides thereof.  A first phase plate (12), a reflective polarizer (14) and a backlight are arranged one over another on the outer surface of the first substrate (1) of the STN liquid-crystal display device (20). A second phase plate (13) and an absorptive polarizer (11) are arranged one over another on the outer surface of the second substrate (2). This device produces bright images with high contrast in achromatic, metallic tone.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se rapporte à un dispositif d'affichage à cristaux liquides TN (nématique en hélice) (20), qui comprend un cristal liquide nématique en hélice de 180 à 270 DEG  placé entre un premier substrat transparent (1) et un second substrat transparent (2), sur les faces intérieures desquels sont placées des électrodes (3, 4) opposées l'une à l'autre. Une première plaque de mise en phase (12), un polariseur réfléchissant (14) et un éclairage en arrière-plan sont disposés superposés sur la surface extérieure du premier substrat (1) du dispositif d'affichage à cristaux liquides STN (nématique en superhélice) (20). Une seconde plaque de mise en phase (13) et un polariseur absorbant (11) sont disposés superposés sur la surface extérieure du second substrat (2). Ce dispositif produit des images claires avec un contraste élevé dans les teintes métalliques, achromatiques.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>